flowchart TD
  Root[根显式批准独立测试轮次] --> Profile[官方新隔离profile与当前用户模型协议]
  Profile --> Baseline[真实原型副本与core8在新profile重跑并required]
  Baseline --> Send[仅一次小修改send]
  Send --> Loader[共享main context importModule 官方JSHandle]
  Loader --> Hook[写start回执并安装测试观察器]
  Hook --> HookFail[发送后基础设施失败]
  HookFail --> Recovery[结构化error保留Run身份和脱敏诊断]
  Recovery --> Retain[保留app和once锁 禁止close cancel resend]
  Send --> Ready[同Run首次生成完成与validating repairRounds=0]
  Ready --> TargetBind[同mount/run Files.resolve与case受限物理目标 唯一性]
  TargetBind --> Candidate[读取真实pending草稿和hash]
  Candidate --> DOM[根核验本次pending DOM与实际可测性]
  DOM --> Plan[根审查精确readonly移除plan]
  Plan --> Inject[真实readDraft/editDraft注入一次]
  Inject --> Fail[原正式浏览器观察readonly断言失败]
  Fail --> Repair[同Pi原预算内最多两轮修正]
  Repair --> Recheck[原core8按原定义完整重过]
  Recheck --> Evidence[绑定完整证据链 repair_evidenced 非人工业务确认]
  Candidate --> NoPlan[未满足当前DOM/hash/required条件]
  NoPlan --> None[not_executed 不重试不编造结果]
  Observe[观察时限不足] --> Continue[返回running 保留app 原Run期限继续]
